From 48570b67fefa7cb79fb62c5a2686aa50d3167c61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 04:13:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Kezan start area completes headless (F-219)

- vehicle: ground-aimed trajectory casts (siege arcs, castFlags 0x02)
- interact: ground-point item use (DEST_LOCATION), SMSG_MESSAGECHAT chat events
- combat: always ask the server where the corpse is (MSG_CORPSE_QUERY)
- start_area.py: trainer visits only when something is learnable; vehicle
  bombard (summoned waves, scripted goal markers, kill-credit impacts);
  credit proxies; class-aware spellhit + stance + range + facing; summoned
  loot GOs set off by activation items; vehicle quiz minigames decoded
  from SAI (prompt text -> phase -> answer); GO-summoned credit (incl.
  gossip-triggered scenes); hidden/stealthed NPC wait; multi-ender turn-in;
  off-navmesh recovery; persistent revive; no-target is not progress;
  condition-gated quests reported separately

Refs F-219, I-384

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
